schema: "0.4"
id: npl-minimal-11-admin-organizations
type: image
quality: high

# NoizuPromptLingo — a structured prompt-definition language + MCP toolchain for building reliable AI agents — platform Admin Organizations screen.
# Theme tenets: near-monochrome gray canvas, single cool sky-blue accent, pure-gray neutrals (no tint), 6px soft radius, gray hairline borders (never hard rules), one soft shadow only on overlays.
# Palette: canvas #ffffff, ink #0a0a0b, sky accent #0284c7, hairline #e0e0e0/#bdbdbd, alt #f5f5f5, warning #d97706, error #dc2626.

prompt:
  system: |
    You are a senior product designer rendering a high-fidelity UI mockup of a
    barely-there, precise console UI — calm, quietly authoritative, near-monochrome,
    in the restrained register of Linear / Vercel dashboards (NOT colorful, NOT
    playful, NOT a marketing page). Humanist sans-serif (Inter) throughout, NO serif.
    A single cool sky-blue accent carries interactivity; everything else is pure gray.
    Type and quiet gray hairlines do the hierarchy — no drop shadows at rest, no
    gradients, no glow. Structure is felt, not shouted.
  text: |
    A 16:9 high-fidelity UI mockup of the platform Admin Organizations screen of
    NoizuPromptLingo, a prompt-engineering and MCP agent-building platform.

    OVERALL LAYOUT (three bands): a slim achromatic LEFT ADMIN NAV RAIL of monochrome
    line icons (Organizations active); a dominant CENTER table area on a pure-white
    canvas; and a RIGHT QUICK-VIEW DRAWER slid in over a faint neutral scrim.

    HEADER BAND: a page title "Organizations" in a 600-weight sans with a muted count
    "342 orgs", and a search input on the right (white field, quiet gray hairline, 6px
    radius, magnifier glyph, placeholder "Search organizations…").

    ORGANIZATION SEARCH TABLE (center): about fourteen rows with quiet gray hairline
    separators, NOT boxed cards. Columns: ORG (name + a small monospace key-prefix chip
    beneath — a quiet gray pill in JetBrains Mono reading "ACME-"), STATUS BADGE (a
    small pill: most "Active" in quiet gray, one "Trial" in amber with a small dot
    glyph, one "Suspended" in muted red with a glyph), MEMBERS (a count), CREATED
    (muted date), and a right-aligned chevron. One row is in a selected state marked by
    a 1px sky-blue left border and a faint sky-tinted background.

    ORG QUICK-VIEW DRAWER (right, about 340px, the selected row's summary): a white
    panel with a soft low shadow on its left edge (the only elevation), softly rounded
    inner elements. It shows the org NAME header, a monospace key-prefix chip, and quiet
    hairline-separated metadata rows — Plan, Members, Owner, Created, Region — each a
    muted label with a value. At the bottom a sky-blue text link "View org dashboard →".

    PALETTE & TYPE: near-monochrome — pure white canvas, whisper-cool near-black ink,
    mid and light pure grays for secondary text and hairlines; one calm cool sky-blue
    as the only accent (selected row, the link, focus). Status color only where
    meaningful (amber trial, muted red suspended), always paired with a glyph.
    Monospace (JetBrains Mono) used only for the literal key-prefix chips; humanist
    sans-serif (Inter) everywhere else, no serif.

    SHAPE & SURFACE: 6px soft corners; quiet gray hairlines for rows and metadata; flat
    tonal surfaces, the single soft shadow reserved for the drawer edge.

    MOOD: precise, calm, supportive — a quiet directory an admin scans to investigate a
    tenant; restraint everywhere, structure felt not shouted.
  negative: "watermark, signature, lorem ipsum placeholder text, low-fidelity wireframe, monitor/device photograph framing, blurry, distorted UI"

output:
  formats:
    - format: png
  dimensions:
    width: 1920
    height: 1080
    aspect_ratio: "16:9"

eval:
  pass_threshold: 0.72
  criteria:
    relevance: {weight: 3, description: "Matches the screen's actual layout and key components as specified"}
    theme_fidelity: {weight: 3, description: "Palette, typography, radius/shape language match the treatise, not generic UI defaults"}
    composition: {weight: 2, description: "Clear visual hierarchy, plausible real-product layout"}
    technical: {weight: 2, description: "Sharp, correct 16:9 aspect, no artifacts"}
  reject_if:
    - "lorem ipsum or placeholder text visible"
    - "watermark or signature visible"
    - "wireframe-level fidelity instead of high-fidelity mockup"

tags: [npl-minimal, NoizuPromptLingo, screen-mockup]
